The platform and what is drawn on it
====================================

This repository holds two different things, under two different terms.

THE PLATFORM -- MIT (see LICENSE)

  The program that draws, edits, saves and publishes a chart: src/app/,
  src/index.html, src/style.css, src/site/ (the schema, the service worker,
  the site's icons), src/i18n/, build.py, tools/, tests/ (except
  tests/fixtures/), worker/, and the documentation. This is what the
  copyright holder in LICENSE claims, and what anyone may use, change and
  share under the MIT licence.

THE CONTENT -- not covered by LICENSE

  "Rhizome Project" is one chart made on this platform, and what it shows
  belongs to its own authors, not to the platform:

    src/chart.json       the chart: its entries, notes, tags and references
    src/media/           pictures, video and fonts the chart carries
    tests/fixtures/      a copy of that chart and its files, used by the tests

  - Franchises, titles, characters and brands named in the chart, among them
    Transformers and every related name, are trademarks and works of their
    owners (Hasbro, Takara Tomy and others). The chart is a fan reference
    made without their involvement or endorsement, and naming them claims
    no right to them.
  - Pictures and video in src/media/ belong to their authors and rights
    holders. They are shown here for reference and commentary; no licence
    to them is granted by this repository.
  - Fonts in src/media/ belong to their designers and are distributed on
    their own terms. "Autobot Characters" (the Ancient Autobot face) is by
    Jim Sorenson, 1997, released as freeware "to be distributed freely".
    Check a font's own terms before using it elsewhere.

A copy of the platform (see DISTRIBUTING.md) should replace the chart with
its own content; the tests do not read it, so nothing depends on it.

Fonts the page loads for its interface from Google Fonts (Big Shoulders
Display, IBM Plex Sans, IBM Plex Mono, Noto Color Emoji) are under the SIL Open Font License, served by Google and
not stored here.
